== Trivia ==
* In the game's lore, the coins spent in the first edition of the '''Technoshop''' were used to fix the [[Hub Island]] in the wake of the [[Dante#Boss Fight|battle]] against {{NPCSprite|Dante}}.
* The [[Shiny Pig]] mechanic, as well as {{Item|The Art of War}} and {{Item|Dante's Ring}} were added into the game as a result of the [[Resistance Movement]], inspired by a player become mayor, [[Resistance Leader|Technoblade]].
* The cost to buy 1 of every item in '''Piggy'''{{'}}s shop except for {{Item|Shiny Orb}}s is {{Item|Shiny Token|amount=1056}}, {{Coins|6000000}}, {{Item|Enchanted Cooked Porkchop|amount=2}}, and {{Item|Enchanted Raw Porkchop|amount=144}}.

